# Firestore Data Model

## Users Collection (`users`)
Stores profile and role information for all authenticated users.
- `uid`: string (Primary Key, matches Firebase Auth UID)
- `name`: string
- `email`: string
- `role`: enum ("admin", "judge", "participant")
- `teamId`: string (optional, foreign key to `teams`)
- `createdAt`: timestamp

## Teams Collection (`teams`)
Stores team metadata, verification status, and aggregate scores.
- `teamId`: string (Primary Key)
- `teamName`: string
- `leaderEmail`: string
- `members`: array<string> (emails or UIDs)
- `college`: string
- `paymentStatus`: enum ("pending", "verified", "rejected")
- `paymentScreenshot`: string (URL to Firebase Storage)
- `round1Status`: enum ("qualified", "rejected", "pending")
- `round2Status`: enum ("qualified", "rejected", "pending")
- `finalStatus`: enum ("winner", "runner-up", "none")
- `totalScore`: number
- `createdAt`: timestamp

## Submissions Collection (`submissions`)
Stores project deliverables for each team.
- `teamId`: string (Primary Key / Document ID)
- `pptLink`: string
- `githubLink`: string
- `deployLink`: string
- `submittedAt`: timestamp
- `lastUpdated`: timestamp

## Scores Collection (`scores`)
Individual scores given by judges for specific rounds.
- `scoreId`: string (Primary Key)
- `teamId`: string
- `judgeId`: string
- `round`: number (1, 2, or 3)
- `criteriaScores`: map
  - `innovation`: number
  - `technicalComplexity`: number
  - `presentation`: number
  - `utility`: number
- `total`: number
- `feedback`: string
- `createdAt`: timestamp

## Notifications Collection (`notifications`) (Optional)
- `userId`: string
- `message`: string
- `type`: string
- `read`: boolean
- `createdAt`: timestamp
